  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, and transformer aggregation achieve high accuracy (config_001: 0.724989). This experiment tests the effect of profile setting (singleprofile) and aggregation (None) while keeping RNA encoder and image encoder consistent. It isolates the impact of profile setting and aggregation, which are critical design choices with uncertain optimal configurations. The comparison to config_001 (multiprofile) and config_040 (resnet50 image encoder) provides a clear baseline for evaluating these parameters."
